{"id":"13.2","title":"Skal du på foreldremøte?","audio":"audio/13.2.mp3","duration":103.21,"synthetic":false,"sentences":[{"id":0,"start":0.15,"end":4.5,"text":"13.2 Skal du på foreldremøte?","heading":true,"zh":"13.2 你要去开家长会吗？","words":[[0,4,0.15,1.32,"13.2"],[5,9,2.2,2.96,"skal~0145ff0d5f10"],[10,12,2.96,3.2,"du"],[13,15,3.2,3.44,"på~4adb194eb020"],[16,28,3.44,4.42,"foreldremøte"]]},{"id":1,"start":6.71,"end":13.01,"text":"Leyla skal hente Ismail på skolen i dag fordi han skal til tannlegen.","zh":"莱拉今天要去学校接伊斯梅尔，因为他要去看牙医。","words":[[0,5,6.79,7.26,"leyla"],[6,10,7.26,7.66,"skal"],[11,16,7.66,8.1,"hente"],[17,23,8.1,8.9,"ismail"],[24,26,8.9,9.22,"på"],[27,33,9.22,9.62,"skolen"],[34,35,9.62,9.8,"i~de136e71704d"],[36,39,9.8,9.98,"dag"],[40,45,10.72,11.34,"fordi"],[46,49,11.34,11.6,"han"],[50,54,11.6,11.88,"skal~e65efaba04da"],[55,58,11.88,12.14,"til"],[59,68,12.14,12.93,"tannlegen"]]},{"id":2,"start":14.01,"end":18.7,"text":"På skolen møter hun Kari, mora til Eivind.","zh":"她在学校遇到了卡丽，埃温德的妈妈。","words":[[0,2,14.09,14.47,"på"],[3,9,14.47,14.93,"skolen"],[10,15,15.57,15.89,"møter~3af274b85884"],[16,19,15.89,16.05,"hun"],[20,24,16.05,16.47,"kari"],[26,30,17.32,17.76,"mora"],[31,34,17.76,18.0,"til~fe22a76f0dea"],[35,41,18.0,18.62,"eivind"]]},{"id":3,"start":20.42,"end":30.17,"text":"Hei, Leyla! Har du lest mail? Vi har fått innkalling til foreldremøte i neste uke. Skal du dit?","speaker":"Kari","zh":"你好，莱拉！你看邮件了吗？我们收到了下周开家长会的通知。你去吗？","words":[[0,3,20.5,20.88,"hei"],[5,10,21.0,21.14,"leyla"],[12,15,22.06,22.64,"har~8b9792170cca"],[16,18,22.64,22.84,"du"],[19,23,22.84,23.16,"lest"],[24,28,23.16,23.6,"mail"],[30,32,24.73,24.93,"vi"],[33,36,24.93,25.03,"har~8b9792170cca"],[37,41,25.03,25.17,"fått"],[42,52,25.17,25.77,"innkalling"],[53,56,25.77,26.09,"til~9af99ff4a231"],[57,69,26.09,27.21,"foreldremøte"],[70,71,27.21,27.65,"i"],[72,77,27.65,27.87,"neste~7e3b29d91cf1"],[78,81,27.87,28.21,"uke"],[83,87,29.1,29.5,"skal~0145ff0d5f10"],[88,90,29.5,29.68,"du"],[91,94,29.68,30.09,"dit"]]},{"id":4,"start":30.43,"end":31.72,"text":"Nei.","speaker":"Leyla","zh":"不去。","words":[[0,3,30.78,31.64,"nei"]]},{"id":5,"start":32.29,"end":33.11,"text":"Hvorfor ikke?","speaker":"Kari","zh":"为什么不去？","words":[[0,7,32.37,32.62,"hvorfor"],[8,12,32.62,33.03,"ikke"]]},{"id":6,"start":34.03,"end":37.62,"text":"Jeg … jeg tror ikke at jeg skal gå fordi læreren snakker så fort.","speaker":"Leyla","zh":"我……我想我不去了，因为老师说话太快了。","words":[[0,3,34.11,34.26,"jeg"],[6,9,34.26,34.36,"jeg"],[10,14,34.56,34.62,"tror"],[15,19,34.62,34.88,"ikke"],[20,22,34.88,35.04,"at"],[23,26,35.04,35.18,"jeg"],[27,31,35.18,35.42,"skal"],[32,34,35.42,35.74,"gå"],[35,40,35.92,36.12,"fordi"],[41,48,36.12,36.62,"læreren"],[49,56,36.62,37.08,"snakker"],[57,59,37.08,37.28,"så~996cf1d57573"],[60,64,37.28,37.54,"fort"]]},{"id":7,"start":37.63,"end":51.41,"text":"Men alle foreldre bør gå på foreldremøte. Det er viktig å vise barna våre at vi er interesserte i skolen deres, og det er veldig nyttig fordi vi får mye informasjon.","speaker":"Kari","zh":"可是所有家长都应该去开家长会。让孩子们看到我们关心他们的学校很重要，而且家长会很有用，因为我们能得到很多信息。","words":[[0,3,38.4,39.04,"men"],[4,8,39.04,39.44,"alle~6873d9584096"],[9,17,39.44,40.1,"foreldre"],[18,21,40.1,40.38,"bør"],[22,24,40.38,40.62,"gå~ee02d34100d5"],[25,27,40.62,40.78,"på~2e131cb042b9"],[28,40,40.78,41.56,"foreldremøte"],[42,45,42.34,42.58,"det~5e977a82af29"],[46,48,42.58,42.64,"er"],[49,55,42.64,43.18,"viktig"],[56,57,43.18,43.58,"å~0583da7a620a"],[58,62,43.58,43.96,"vise"],[63,68,43.96,44.36,"barna"],[69,73,44.36,44.68,"våre"],[74,76,44.68,45.08,"at"],[77,79,45.08,45.18,"vi"],[80,82,45.18,45.32,"er"],[83,95,45.32,46.24,"interesserte"],[96,97,46.24,46.44,"i~50052aac3f2e"],[98,104,46.44,46.82,"skolen"],[105,110,46.82,47.24,"deres"],[112,114,47.72,48.08,"og"],[115,118,48.08,48.18,"det"],[119,121,48.18,48.22,"er"],[122,128,48.22,48.52,"veldig"],[129,135,48.52,49.02,"nyttig"],[136,141,49.02,49.58,"fordi"],[142,144,49.58,49.74,"vi"],[145,148,49.74,49.96,"får"],[149,152,49.96,50.42,"mye~cc164d0dc3da"],[153,164,50.42,51.33,"informasjon"]]},{"id":8,"start":52.49,"end":56.8,"text":"Jeg vet ikke, for jeg forstår ikke alt læreren sier.","speaker":"Leyla","zh":"我不知道，因为老师说的话我不是全都听得懂。","words":[[0,3,52.57,52.74,"jeg"],[4,7,52.74,52.92,"vet"],[8,12,52.92,53.2,"ikke"],[14,17,53.68,54.18,"for~1b22712a94b1"],[18,21,54.18,54.48,"jeg"],[22,29,54.48,55.04,"forstår"],[30,34,55.04,55.32,"ikke"],[35,38,55.32,55.62,"alt"],[39,46,55.62,56.12,"læreren"],[47,51,56.12,56.72,"sier"]]},{"id":9,"start":57.81,"end":70.31,"text":"Du kan sitte sammen med meg, og jeg kan forklare deg litt. Det blir fint for deg å treffe læreren, og foreldremøter er en fin måte å bli kjent med de andre foreldrene på.","speaker":"Kari","zh":"你可以和我坐在一起，我可以给你解释一下。见见老师对你有好处，而且家长会也是认识其他家长的好方式。","words":[[0,2,57.89,58.04,"du"],[3,6,58.04,58.22,"kan"],[7,12,58.22,58.48,"sitte"],[13,19,58.48,59.0,"sammen"],[20,23,59.0,59.14,"med"],[24,27,59.14,59.38,"meg"],[29,31,60.07,60.17,"og"],[32,35,60.17,60.41,"jeg"],[36,39,60.41,60.67,"kan"],[40,48,60.67,61.21,"forklare"],[49,52,61.21,61.35,"deg"],[53,57,61.35,61.59,"litt~462e893626a5"],[59,62,62.53,62.67,"det~5e977a82af29"],[63,67,62.67,62.85,"blir"],[68,72,62.85,63.29,"fint"],[73,76,63.29,63.51,"for~da1a474a7e8c"],[77,80,63.51,63.69,"deg"],[81,82,63.69,63.95,"å~0583da7a620a"],[83,89,63.95,64.27,"treffe"],[90,97,64.27,64.65,"læreren"],[99,101,65.15,65.33,"og"],[102,115,65.33,66.29,"foreldremøter"],[116,118,66.29,66.61,"er"],[119,121,66.61,66.73,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[122,125,66.73,67.09,"fin"],[126,130,67.09,67.69,"måte"],[131,132,67.69,67.89,"å~0583da7a620a"],[133,136,67.89,68.05,"bli"],[137,142,68.05,68.37,"kjent~43c3ae802868"],[143,146,68.37,68.69,"med~55c996fa7248"],[147,149,68.69,68.79,"de~de84f31e2c1a"],[150,155,68.79,69.29,"andre~0c69ef1e750c"],[156,166,69.29,69.85,"foreldrene"],[167,169,69.85,70.23,"på~bd4bdf3e610e"]]},{"id":10,"start":71.58,"end":80.52,"text":"Da jeg gikk på barneskolen i Syria, hadde vi aldri foreldremøter. Hva pleier dere å snakke om når dere er på foreldremøter?","speaker":"Leyla","zh":"我在叙利亚上小学的时候，我们从来没有开过家长会。你们开家长会时一般都谈些什么？","words":[[0,2,71.66,71.82,"da~3ded9627966c"],[3,6,71.82,72.04,"jeg"],[7,11,72.04,72.28,"gikk~b33c04bf7fc2"],[12,14,72.28,72.48,"på"],[15,26,72.48,73.14,"barneskolen"],[27,28,73.14,73.3,"i"],[29,34,73.3,73.64,"syria~2ae242f98808"],[36,41,74.3,74.54,"hadde"],[42,44,74.54,74.66,"vi"],[45,50,74.66,75.06,"aldri"],[51,64,75.06,76.06,"foreldremøter"],[66,69,76.62,77.24,"hva"],[70,76,77.24,77.76,"pleier"],[77,81,77.76,77.92,"dere"],[82,83,77.92,78.1,"å~0583da7a620a"],[84,90,78.1,78.48,"snakke"],[91,93,78.48,78.68,"om~04781d07f4aa"],[94,97,78.68,78.9,"når~8cac549467d0"],[98,102,78.9,79.08,"dere"],[103,105,79.08,79.32,"er"],[106,108,79.32,79.48,"på"],[109,122,79.48,80.44,"foreldremøter"]]},{"id":11,"start":81.33,"end":91.93,"text":"Læreren pleier å snakke om klassemiljøet, om planer for året og aktiviteter som de skal ha. Vi kan også stille spørsmål til læreren.","speaker":"Kari","zh":"老师一般会谈班级氛围、这一年的计划和要开展的活动。我们也可以向老师提问。","words":[[0,7,81.41,81.94,"læreren"],[8,14,81.94,82.32,"pleier"],[15,16,82.32,82.62,"å~0583da7a620a"],[17,23,82.62,82.98,"snakke"],[24,26,82.98,83.16,"om~d7c8e64e375a"],[27,40,83.16,84.22,"klassemiljøet"],[42,44,84.77,84.89,"om~52c0bdc828db"],[45,51,84.89,85.57,"planer"],[52,55,85.57,85.75,"for~8df9de8be415"],[56,60,85.75,86.23,"året"],[61,63,86.23,86.83,"og"],[64,75,86.83,87.71,"aktiviteter"],[76,79,87.71,87.99,"som~b7970b8f941e"],[80,82,87.99,88.13,"de"],[83,87,88.13,88.31,"skal"],[88,90,88.31,88.53,"ha~f87c14118226"],[92,94,89.63,89.79,"vi"],[95,98,89.79,89.93,"kan"],[99,103,89.93,90.19,"også"],[104,110,90.19,90.53,"stille~c9c8dcefa2ae"],[111,119,90.53,91.15,"spørsmål"],[120,123,91.15,91.37,"til~10260269c38d"],[124,131,91.37,91.85,"læreren"]]},{"id":12,"start":91.96,"end":94.46,"text":"Det høres fint ut.","speaker":"Leyla","zh":"听起来不错。","words":[[0,3,92.57,93.21,"det"],[4,9,93.21,93.59,"høres~86b1ccbe85b9"],[10,14,93.59,93.85,"fint"],[15,17,93.85,94.38,"ut~ce9929451d11"]]},{"id":13,"start":95.18,"end":99.84,"text":"Ja, vi kan gå dit sammen. Det blir hyggelig.","speaker":"Kari","zh":"好，我们可以一起去。会很愉快的。","words":[[0,2,95.26,95.59,"ja"],[4,6,96.45,96.75,"vi"],[7,10,96.75,96.89,"kan"],[11,13,96.89,97.07,"gå"],[14,17,97.07,97.21,"dit"],[18,24,97.21,97.77,"sammen"],[26,29,98.68,98.96,"det"],[30,34,98.96,99.18,"blir"],[35,43,99.18,99.76,"hyggelig"]]}],"lexicon":{"13.2":{"lemma":"13.2","zh":"第 13.2 节","pos":"编号","ref":null,"clip":null,"kind":"section"},"aktiviteter":{"lemma":"aktivitet","zh":"活动","pos":"名词","ref":"13-045","form":"复数不定","clip":null},"aldri":{"lemma":"aldri","zh":"从不；从来没有","pos":"副词","ref":"basics:grammar:aldri","clip":"pronunciation/d1f5a7278af42576f5dd.mp3"},"alle":{"lemma":"all","zh":"所有的；所有人；全部","pos":"数量限定词／代词","form":"复数","ref":null,"clip":"pronunciation/2146a029ad5e62ec7869.mp3"},"alt":{"lemma":"alt","zh":"一切","pos":"代词","ref":"10-054","clip":"pronunciation/4d48fba6cf5f7d6abfb3.mp3"},"andre":{"lemma":"andre","zh":"其他的；别的（annen 的复数）；第二","pos":"代词／序数词","ref":"basics:ordinals:andre","clip":"pronunciation/bd01b0b648c2c64eb1bd.mp3","ambiguous":true,"candidates":[{"lemma":"andre","zh":"其他的；别的（annen 的复数）；第二","pos":"代词／序数词","ref":"basics:ordinals:andre"},{"lemma":"andre","zh":"第二","pos":"序数词","ref":"basics:ordinals:andre"},{"lemma":"annen","zh":"其他","pos":"形容词","ref":"11-037","form":"变化形式"}]},"at":{"lemma":"at","zh":"（连词）引导从句，常不译出","pos":"从属连词","ref":"12-005","clip":"pronunciation/b1d6b91b67c2afa5e322.mp3"},"barna":{"lemma":"barn","zh":"孩子","pos":"名词","ref":"basics:family:barn","form":"复数定指","clip":null},"barneskolen":{"lemma":"barneskole","zh":"小学","pos":"名词","ref":"4-056","form":"单数定指","clip":null},"bli":{"lemma":"bli","zh":"变成；成为；留下（依语境）","pos":"动词","ref":"9-068","form":"不定式","clip":"pronunciation/5f2c0653c7f703abf9ac.mp3"},"blir":{"lemma":"bli","zh":"变成；（将）会；留下","pos":"动词","ref":"5-065","form":"现在时","clip":"pronunciation/9422127081333b8048f1.mp3"},"bør":{"lemma":"burde","zh":"应该（burde 的现在时）","pos":"情态动词","ref":"pa-vei-7-088"